name 'iterating-with-ai-postassessment-q14_2025'

question 'In an interactive dashboard, why is a "Reset" button considered a user control feature?'

wrong 'It allows the developer to track what the user is doing.'
wrong 'It prevents the user from using any AI tools within the app.'
wrong 'It is the only way to save the data to the cloud.'
right 'It gives the user the power to quickly recover from complex filtering or mistakes and return to a known state.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 11

User control is a key principle of design. A reset button ensures users feel safe exploring the data because they can always return to the original view.
MARKDOWN
